OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSATown could become Olympic training
OL,4,Ahub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town could become home to a unique
OL,7,Ftraining facility for one of the
OL,8,FOlympic Games' newest disciplines after
OL,9,Fplans for a specialist obstacle course
OL,10,Fwere approved.
OL,12,FThe facility will be built at Wilsons
OL,13,FPlaying Fields in Clayton-le-Moors,
OL,14,FLancashire, after Hyndburn Borough
OL,15,FCouncil granted planning permission.
OL,17,FApplication documents said the
OL,18,Fdevelopment was intended to support the
OL,19,Fgrowing obstacle racing discipline in
OL,20,Fmodern pentathlon and was believed to
OL,21,Fbe "the only training rig of its kind
OL,22,Fnorth of Bath in the UK".
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
